Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 108; favorites: 8; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, dither, charts, support.\n## Overview\nAura Interactive Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nAura. 50 Interactive Components Fluid, Performant And Distinct Gestures For Everyone! STAY INFORMED A completely new interaction LESS IS MORE Motion through Gestures Interfaces that developers care about 25 UI Kit Kinet…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: 50 Interactive Components; A completely new interaction; Motion through Gestures; Interfaces that developers care about; 25 UI Kit; Elevating drag interfaces.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #8B5CF6, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #1A0B2E, background #1A0B2E, surface #E8C7CD, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura - Interactive Gestures</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased text-slate-50 min-h-screen w-full relative flex flex-col justify-center items-center m-0 overflow-hidden bg-[#1a0b2e]\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Background Elements -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\">\n        <!-- Radial Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_60%_at_50%_0%,rgba(91,46,145,0.6)_0%,rgba(26,11,46,1)_100%)]\"></div>\n        <!-- Dot Pattern -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-40 mix-blend-screen\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px; background-position: center top; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 20%, black 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 20%, black 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n        <!-- Subtle noise texture -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.65%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Layout overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-6 pointer-events-none z-50 border border-white/10\" id=\"frame-container\">\n        <div class=\"absolute bg-white/5 w-[1px] h-full top-0 left-1/4\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bg-white/5 w-[1px] h-full top-0 right-1/4\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bg-white/5 h-[1px] w-full left-0 top-24\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute w-4 h-4 border border-white/20 pointer-events-none -top-[1px] -left-[1px] border-r-0 border-b-0\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute w-4 h-4 border border-white/20 pointer-events-none -top-[1px] -right-[1px] border-l-0 border-b-0\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute w-4 h-4 border border-white/20 pointer-events-none -bottom-[1px] -left-[1px] border-r-0 border-t-0\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute w-4 h-4 border border-white/20 pointer-events-none -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] border-l-0 border-t-0\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-between pt-10 pb-16 px-4 flex-1\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full max-w-6xl flex justify-between items-center px-8 relative opacity-0\" id=\"header\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-5 rounded-full border border-white/30 flex items-center p-[2px] bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-4\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight\">Aura.</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Action Icon -->\n            <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:videocamera-record-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Typography Section -->\n        <section class=\"text-center mt-12 mb-8 relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-6xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-white/70\" id=\"main-title\">\n                50 Interactive Components\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300 font-normal tracking-wide mt-4 max-w-2xl opacity-0\" id=\"subtitle\">\n                Fluid, Performant And Distinct Gestures For Everyone!\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Cards Stage -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl flex-1 min-h-[450px] flex justify-center items-center perspective-[1200px]\" id=\"cards-stage\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1 (Far Left, Back) -->\n            <div class=\"card-wrapper absolute w-[240px] h-[340px] sm:w-[280px] sm:h-[380px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-[#0f205c]\" data-index=\"0\" style=\"background-clip: padding-box; border: 1px solid transparent; transform-style: preserve-3d; will-change: transform, opacity; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[-1] -m-[1px] rounded-[inherit] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                    <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266280157-6f215bae-1f48-46e2-9763-842284d64d82.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 mix-blend-overlay\" alt=\"Abstract Blue\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266280157-6f215bae-1f48-46e2-9763-842284d64d82.png\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full p-6 flex flex-col justify-between z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wider text-blue-200\">STAY INFORMED</p>\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white leading-tight\">A completely<br>new interaction</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2 (Mid Left) -->\n            <div class=\"card-wrapper absolute w-[240px] h-[340px] sm:w-[280px] sm:h-[380px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"background-clip: padding-box; border: 1px solid transparent; transform-style: preserve-3d; will-change: transform, opacity; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[-1] -m-[1px] rounded-[inherit] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"h-2/3 w-full relative\">\n                        <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266304043-df1ba66f-b4db-4f7c-8885-f36fa47b7f5b.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80\" alt=\"Purple Gradient\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266304043-df1ba66f-b4db-4f7c-8885-f36fa47b7f5b.png\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"h-1/3 w-full bg-[#9b2cfa] rounded-tl-3xl relative -mt-4 shadow-[0_-10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full p-6 flex flex-col z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wider text-purple-900 mt-2\">LESS IS MORE</p>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mt-2 leading-[0.9]\">Motion<br>through<br>Gestures</h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4 (Mid Right) -->\n            <div class=\"card-wrapper absolute w-[240px] h-[340px] sm:w-[280px] sm:h-[380px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-[#00a8ff]\" data-index=\"3\" style=\"background-clip: padding-box; border: 1px solid transparent; transform-style: preserve-3d; will-change: transform, opacity; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[-1] -m-[1px] rounded-[inherit] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"h-3/5 w-full relative flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                        <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266331178-b7d2e902-bbc3-4df3-8dc8-0214c8c120f4.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl shadow-lg\" alt=\"3D Structure\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266331178-b7d2e902-bbc3-4df3-8dc8-0214c8c120f4.png\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"h-2/5 w-full bg-white relative rounded-tl-[40px] flex items-center p-6 shadow-[0_-10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)]\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#006b99] uppercase leading-tight\">Interfaces that developers care about</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 5 (Far Right, Back) -->\n            <div class=\"card-wrapper absolute w-[240px] h-[340px] sm:w-[280px] sm:h-[380px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-[#e60000]\" data-index=\"4\" style=\"background-clip: padding-box; border: 1px solid transparent; transform-style: preserve-3d; will-change: transform, opacity; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[-1] -m-[1px] rounded-[inherit] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266358277-7680eff0-4f4f-4485-9e39-f5bbbd465196.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 mix-blend-multiply filter contrast-125\" alt=\"Silhouette\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266358277-7680eff0-4f4f-4485-9e39-f5bbbd465196.png\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full p-6 flex flex-col justify-end items-end z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white/90 text-right uppercase\">25<br>UI<br>Kit</h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3 (Center, Front - Hero Card) -->\n            <div class=\"card-wrapper absolute w-[260px] h-[360px] sm:w-[300px] sm:h-[420px] rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden z-50 border border-white/20\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"background-clip: padding-box; transform-style: preserve-3d; will-change: transform, opacity; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[-1] -m-[1px] rounded-[inherit] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266383471-125de48c-dfee-4529-b292-f1862d7dad44.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" alt=\"Portrait Backdrop\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-05-20/1779266383471-125de48c-dfee-4529-b292-f1862d7dad44.png\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#e5d9c5]/60 via-[#c9a795]/70 to-[#6b5850]/90 mix-blend-hard-light border border-white/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4px 4px; mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 40%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 40%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full p-8 flex flex-col justify-end z-10 pb-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-white/90 uppercase mb-2\">Kinetic Framework</p>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-white leading-[0.9] mb-4 drop-shadow-md\">Elevating<br>drag<br>interfaces</h2>\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-[6px] border-[#e8c7cd] bg-transparent shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(232,199,205,0.5)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // --- Utility: Split Text into spans for character animation ---\n            const splitText = (element) => {\n                const text = element.innerText;\n                element.innerHTML = '';\n                text.split('').forEach(char => {\n                    if(char === ' ') {\n                        element.innerHTML += ' ';\n                    } else {\n                        const span = document.createElement('span');\n                        span.innerText = char;\n                        span.className = 'char';\n                        span.style.cssText = 'display: inline-block; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); pointer-events: none;';\n                        element.appendChild(span);\n                    }\n                });\n            };\n\n            const titleEl = document.getElementById('main-title');\n            splitText(titleEl);\n\n            // --- Three.js WebGL Background (Subtle Particles) ---\n            const initWebGL = () => {\n                const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n                const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n                const particlesCount = 300;\n                const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n                for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                    posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 15;\n                }\n\n                particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n                const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                    size: 0.02,\n                    color: 0x9b85c4,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.4,\n                    blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n                });\n\n                const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, material);\n                scene.add(particlesMesh);\n                camera.position.z = 5;\n\n                let mouseX = 0;\n                let mouseY = 0;\n\n                document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                    mouseX = event.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5;\n                    mouseY = event.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5;\n                });\n\n                const animateParticles = () => {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animateParticles);\n                    particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.001;\n                    particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.0005;\n\n                    particlesMesh.position.x += (mouseX * 0.5 - particlesMesh.position.x) * 0.05;\n                    particlesMesh.position.y += (-mouseY * 0.5 - particlesMesh.position.y) * 0.05;\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                };\n\n                animateParticles();\n\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                });\n            };\n\n            try { initWebGL(); } catch(e) { console.log('WebGL fallback activated.'); }\n\n            // --- GSAP Motion Design Sequence ---\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.card-wrapper');\n\n            const cardTargets = [\n                { x: -300, y: 80, rotateZ: -24, scale: 0.85, zIndex: 10 },\n                { x: -160, y: 30, rotateZ: -12, scale: 0.9, zIndex: 20 },\n                { x: 0, y: -20, rotateZ: 0, scale: 1, zIndex: 50 },\n                { x: 160, y: 30, rotateZ: 12, scale: 0.9, zIndex: 20 },\n                { x: 300, y: 80, rotateZ: 24, scale: 0.85, zIndex: 10 }\n            ];\n\n            const isMobile = window.innerWidth < 768;\n            if (isMobile) {\n                cardTargets[0] = { x: -100, y: 60, rotateZ: -15, scale: 0.7, zIndex: 10 };\n                cardTargets[1] = { x: -50, y: 20, rotateZ: -8, scale: 0.8, zIndex: 20 };\n                cardTargets[2] = { x: 0, y: 0, rotateZ: 0, scale: 0.95, zIndex: 50 };\n                cardTargets[3] = { x: 50, y: 20, rotateZ: 8, scale: 0.8, zIndex: 20 };\n                cardTargets[4] = { x: 100, y: 60, rotateZ: 15, scale: 0.7, zIndex: 10 };\n            }\n\n            gsap.set(cards, {\n                y: 200,\n                opacity: 0,\n                rotateZ: 0,\n                scale: 0.5,\n                transformPerspective: 1000\n            });\n            gsap.set('#frame-container', { opacity: 0, scale: 0.98 });\n\n            tl.to('#frame-container', { duration: 1.5, opacity: 1, scale: 1, ease: \"expo.out\" }, 0.2)\n              .to('#header', { duration: 1, opacity: 1, y: 0, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 0.5)\n              .to('.char', { duration: 0.8, opacity: 1, y: 0, stagger: 0.02, ease: \"back.out(1.5)\" }, 0.8)\n              .to('#subtitle', { duration: 1, opacity: 1, y: 0 }, 1.2);\n\n            const cardElements = Array.from(cards);\n            const centerCard = cardElements.find(c => c.dataset.index == 2);\n            const midCards = [cardElements.find(c => c.dataset.index == 1), cardElements.find(c => c.dataset.index == 3)];\n            const outerCards = [cardElements.find(c => c.dataset.index == 0), cardElements.find(c => c.dataset.index == 4)];\n\n            tl.to(centerCard, {\n                duration: 1.2, opacity: 1, y: cardTargets[2].y, x: cardTargets[2].x,\n                rotateZ: cardTargets[2].rotateZ, scale: cardTargets[2].scale, zIndex: cardTargets[2].zIndex, ease: \"expo.out\"\n            }, 1.5)\n            .to(midCards, {\n                duration: 1.4, opacity: 1, y: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].y, x: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].x,\n                rotateZ: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].rotateZ, scale: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].scale,\n                zIndex: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].zIndex, ease: \"back.out(1.2)\"\n            }, 1.7)\n            .to(outerCards, {\n                duration: 1.6, opacity: 1, y: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].y, x: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].x,\n                rotateZ: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].rotateZ, scale: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].scale,\n                zIndex: (i, el) => cardTargets[el.dataset.index].zIndex, ease: \"back.out(1.1)\"\n            }, 1.9);\n\n            const startFloat = (card) => {\n                gsap.to(card, {\n                    y: `+=${Math.random() * 10 + 5}`,\n                    duration: 2 + Math.random(),\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    delay: Math.random()\n                });\n            };\n\n            tl.add(() => { cards.forEach(card => startFloat(card)); }, \"-=0.5\");\n\n            // --- Interactive Drag & Snap Gestures ---\n            let activeCard = null;\n            let startMouseX = 0;\n            let startMouseY = 0;\n            let startCardX = 0;\n            let startCardY = 0;\n\n            cards.forEach(card => {\n                card.style.touchAction = \"none\";\n                card.style.cursor = \"grab\";\n\n                card.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => {\n                    activeCard = card;\n                    const idx = card.dataset.index;\n\n                    gsap.killTweensOf(card);\n\n                    startMouseX = e.clientX;\n                    startMouseY = e.clientY;\n                    startCardX = gsap.getProperty(card, \"x\");\n                    startCardY = gsap.getProperty(card, \"y\");\n\n                    card.style.cursor = \"grabbing\";\n\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        scale: cardTargets[idx].scale + 0.05,\n                        rotateZ: cardTargets[idx].rotateZ * 0.2, // Flatten out slightly\n                        zIndex: 200,\n                        duration: 0.3,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        boxShadow: \"0 40px 80px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 60px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4)\"\n                    });\n\n                    card.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                });\n\n                card.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\n                    if (activeCard !== card) return;\n\n                    const deltaX = e.clientX - startMouseX;\n                    const deltaY = e.clientY - startMouseY;\n\n                    gsap.set(card, {\n                        x: startCardX + deltaX,\n                        y: startCardY + deltaY\n                    });\n                });\n\n                card.addEventListener('pointerup', (e) => {\n                    if (activeCard !== card) return;\n\n                    card.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                    activeCard = null;\n                    card.style.cursor = \"grab\";\n                    const idx = card.dataset.index;\n\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        x: cardTargets[idx].x,\n                        y: cardTargets[idx].y,\n                        scale: cardTargets[idx].scale,\n                        rotateZ: cardTargets[idx].rotateZ,\n                        zIndex: cardTargets[idx].zIndex,\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.6)\",\n                        boxShadow: \"0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1)\",\n                        onComplete: () => startFloat(card)\n                    });\n                });\n\n                card.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n                    if (activeCard === card) return;\n                    const idx = card.dataset.index;\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        scale: cardTargets[idx].scale + 0.05,\n                        rotateZ: cardTargets[idx].rotateZ * 0.6,\n                        zIndex: 100,\n                        duration: 0.4,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        boxShadow: \"0 30px 60px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), 0 0 50px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3)\"\n                    });\n                });\n\n                card.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    if (activeCard === card) return;\n                    const idx = card.dataset.index;\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        scale: cardTargets[idx].scale,\n                        rotateZ: cardTargets[idx].rotateZ,\n                        zIndex: cardTargets[idx].zIndex,\n                        duration: 0.5,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        boxShadow: \"0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1)\"\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-interactive-gestures.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aura-interactive-gestures.jpg", "source_name": "aura-interactive-gestures-DESIGN.md", "views": 249, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T16:24:15.814361+00:00"}